ter\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 해당 버전 설치</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> express@4.1.0\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 최신 버전 설치</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> express@latest</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"패키지-버전-변화-확인\" style=\"position:relative;\">패키지 버전 변화 확인<a href=\"#%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80-%EB%B2%84%EC%A0%84-%EB%B3%80%ED%99%94-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"패키지 버전 변화 확인 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 버전 확인</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 어떤 패키지에 기능 변화가 생겼는지 확인</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> outdated</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><img src=\"/assets/images/posts/2024/01/26/npm-02.png\" alt=\"alt text\">\r\n<em><a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/NODE-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%85%B8%EB%93%9C-npmnode-package-manager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/NODE-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%85%B8%EB%93%9C-npmnode-package-manager</a></em></p>\n<h3 id=\"패키지-버전-올림-업데이트\" style=\"position:relative;\">패키지 버전 올림 (업데이트)<a href=\"#%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80-%EB%B2%84%EC%A0%84-%EC%98%AC%EB%A6%BC-%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8\" aria-label=\"패키지 버전 올림 업데이트 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>: package.json의 버전을 올림 (git에 커밋도 함)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 패치 버전이 올라감</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> version patch\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 마이너 버전이 올라감</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> version minor\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 메이저 버전이 올라감</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> version major</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"패키지-배포\" style=\"position:relative;\">패키지 배포<a href=\"#%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80-%EB%B0%B0%ED%8F%AC\" aria-label=\"패키지 배포 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 패키지를 설치할 때 경고 메시지를 띄우게 함 (오류가 있는 패키지에 적용)</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> deprecate <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>패키지명<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>버전<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>메시지<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 자신이 만든 패키지를 배포</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> publish\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 자신이 만든 패키지를 배포 중단 (배포 후 72시간 내에만 가능)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 다른 사람이 내 패키지를 사용하고 있는데 배포가 중단되면 문제가 생기기 때문</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> unpublish <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--force</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"패키지-검색\" style=\"position:relative;\">패키지 검색<a href=\"#%ED%8C%A8%ED%82%A4%EC%A7%80-%EA%B2%80%EC%83%89\" aria-label=\"패키지 검색 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># npm 패키지를 검색할 수 있음. (npmjs.com에서도 가능)</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> search <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>검색어<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"사용자-확인\" style=\"position:relative;\">사용자 확인<a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EC%9E%90-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"사용자 확인 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41